# The native C and C++ format (D00 T05 §4), checked by scripts/native-format.ps1. A default: Microsoft's base style with
# three deviations, which the C++ standard (D00 T04 §1) cites; changing it costs one reformat commit
# (docs/dev/decisions.md, "2026-10-23: The native format style").
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
ColumnLimit: 120
PointerAlignment: Left
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
